Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:49.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Should you offer your body unto this banquet of punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:55.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The ritual will impart its whirling melody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:05.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The faint light of night runs with blood, wandering screams beg before visions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:14.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Flickering flames grow in the rear of your mind, toward the place that awakens your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:19.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Knowing not even the meaning of their birth in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:24.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The pilgrims know only the bounds of this dark night
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:34.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}In the hour of crossing the grieving river, the scenery will be frozen as violet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:45.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Even if you lose all desire, your prayers can still be grasped
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:54.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The judged believers scream out, those gathered who rebel are but darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:02:05.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Along with the profound pain of the driven stakes, repentance fades into legend
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:09.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}A trap of falsehoods, a shadow of black now erased
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:15.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}It is the hour of the fall, of scattered ruin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:31.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Should these prayers reach the sparkling violet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:36.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Then destiny will be to sing the sorrowful melody
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:46.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}A chain of feelings torn apart and cast aside, leaving painful whispers lasting forevermore
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:55.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The deluge of duties is eaten away, meditation arouses your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:03:05.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Erasing even the will that all hold, the pilgrims know only the bounds of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:15.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The gaze is showered by the approaching destination, extending to putrescent fields burnt away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:26.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Should you reflect your heart to the faraway, memories will create that which is certain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:35.70,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}The hopeless believers scream out, those gathered who rebel are but darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:46.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}And now with great vertigo and pain in the bosom, those young child's eyes are legend
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:50.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}A mass of rebirth, a shadow of black now erased
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:56.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}It is the hour of annihilation, unseen as it draws near
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:04:06.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Wish greatly in your heart, knowing only your different world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:11.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Embracing in the bosom a pure heart of wickedness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:19.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,250)\pos(960,50)\blur3}Grieving is each and every person through the violet prayer
